    "created_at": "2016-11-18T18:28:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-18T18:28:39Z",
    "body": "1. Case-sensitive is the current default. I'm not sure how adding an attribute to reinforce the default helps.\n2. Is there precedent in JavaScript libraries for showing this distinction somehow?\n",
