    "created_at": "2016-11-19T15:57:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-19T15:57:51Z",
    "body": "OK, it sounds like we should close this then in favor of you opening issues on browser issue trackers requesting that they warn on caps lock in password fields.\n",
