    "created_at": "2016-11-21T11:51:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-21T11:51:57Z",
    "body": "We generally try not to require anything about user interface issues in the spec, since that is something vendors can compete on. We don't need interoperability on UI. It might also not make sense for all UAs -- consider a device that doesn't have caps-lock at all.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
